### 1. DEFINITIONS

- **"Software"** means the UniDesk Studio application (formerly known as One Tap Workstation), including but not limited to the compiled executable binaries, Electron main and renderer modules, CEP extensions, ExtendScript automation scripts, user interface designs, themes, icons, preloader animations, and accompanying digital documentation.
- **"Output Deliverables"** means any digital media, including rendered video sequences, MP4/MKV files, transcode deliverables, renamed photographs, metadata indices, Excel spreadsheets, and project directories generated or processed by Licensee using the Software.
- **"Workstation"** means a single physical or virtual computing machine (desktop, laptop, or edit bay) running Windows 10, Windows 11, or supported Linux distributions on which the Software is executed.
- **"Commercial Use"** means utilizing the Software within a commercial video production studio, broadcast facility, freelance post-production operation, wedding event studio, agency, or corporate enterprise environment for revenue-generating activities.

