---

### 5. PRIVACY & LOCAL DATA PROCESSING GUARANTEE

#### 5.1 Strictly On-Premise Operation
**Your media stays on your machine.**  
Licensor recognizes that video production and wedding event archives contain sensitive, confidential, and high-value private client footage. The Software executes all video rendering, title insertion, photo renaming, and directory manipulation **100% locally on Licensee's Workstation**.

#### 5.2 Zero Remote Media Transmission
The Software **does not** transmit, upload, or mirror Licensee's video files, camera JPEGs, project XMLs, or event folders to external servers or third-party cloud infrastructure. All local knowledge bases (`.code-analysis/`), token cache indices, and SQLite state databases remain solely on Licensee's local storage drives.

